</span>
</span></span>        <span id="p2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;">
<span id="p2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span class="ltx_tbody">
<span id="p2.1.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
