<section id="Sx2" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section">Checklist</h2>

<div id="Sx2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<ol id="Sx2.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="Sx2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For all models and algorithms presented, check if you include:</p>
<ol id="Sx2.I1.i1.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="Sx2.I1.i1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(a)</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I1.i1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx2.I1.i1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A clear description of the mathematical setting, assumptions, algorithm, and/or model. [Yes]</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx2.I1.i1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(b)</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I1.i1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx2.I1.i1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">An analysis of the properties and complexity (time, space, sample size) of any algorithm. [Yes]</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx2.I1.i1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(c)</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I1.i1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx2.I1.i1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">(Optional) Anonymized source code, with specification of all dependencies, including external libraries. [Yes]</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For any theoretical claim, check if you include:</p>
<ol id="Sx2.I1.i2.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="Sx2.I1.i2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(a)</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx2.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Statements of the full set of assumptions of all theoretical results. [Yes]</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx2.I1.i2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(b)</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx2.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Complete proofs of all theoretical results. [Yes]</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx2.I1.i2.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(c)</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx2.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Clear explanations of any assumptions. [Yes]</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx2.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx2.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For all figures and tables that present empirical results, check if you include:</p>
<ol id="Sx2.I1.i3.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="Sx2.I1.i3.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(a)</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I1.i3.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx2.I1.i3.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The code, data, and instructions needed to reproduce the main experimental results (either in the supplemental material or as a URL). [Yes]</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx2.I1.i3.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(b)</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I1.i3.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx2.I1.i3.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All the training details (e.g., data splits, hyperparameters, how they were chosen). [Yes]</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx2.I1.i3.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(c)</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I1.i3.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx2.I1.i3.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A clear definition of the specific measure or statistics and error bars (e.g., with respect to the random seed after running experiments multiple times). [Yes]</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx2.I1.i3.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(d)</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I1.i3.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx2.I1.i3.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A description of the computing infrastructure used. (e.g., type of GPUs, internal cluster, or cloud provider). [Yes]</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx2.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx2.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">If you are using existing assets (e.g., code, data, models) or curating/releasing new assets, check if you include:</p>
<ol id="Sx2.I1.i4.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="Sx2.I1.i4.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(a)</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx2.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Citations of the creator If your work uses existing assets. [Yes]</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx2.I1.i4.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(b)</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx2.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The license information of the assets, if applicable. [Not Applicable]</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx2.I1.i4.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(c)</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I1.i4.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx2.I1.i4.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">New assets either in the supplemental material or as a URL, if applicable. [Not Applicable]</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx2.I1.i4.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(d)</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I1.i4.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx2.I1.i4.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Information about consent from data providers/curators. [Not Applicable]</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx2.I1.i4.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(e)</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I1.i4.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx2.I1.i4.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Discussion of sensible content if applicable, e.g., personally identifiable information or offensive content. [Not Applicable]</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx2.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">5.</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx2.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">If you used crowdsourcing or conducted research with human subjects, check if you include:</p>
<ol id="Sx2.I1.i5.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="Sx2.I1.i5.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(a)</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I1.i5.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx2.I1.i5.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The full text of instructions given to participants and screenshots. [Not Applicable]</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx2.I1.i5.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(b)</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I1.i5.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx2.I1.i5.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Descriptions of potential participant risks, with links to Institutional Review Board (IRB) approvals if applicable. [Not Applicable]</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx2.I1.i5.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(c)</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I1.i5.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx2.I1.i5.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The estimated hourly wage paid to participants and the total amount spent on participant compensation. [Not Applicable]</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:4.0pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<div id="Sx2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent ltx_align_center">
<p id="Sx2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Sx2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Q-Learning with Shift-Aware Upper Confidence Bound in Non-Stationary Reinforcement Learning (Supplementary Material)</span></p>
</div><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1.0pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<div id="Sx2.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">In this supplementary material, we collect proofs and remaining materials deferred from the main paper. In Appendix <a href="#A1" title="Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A</span></a>, we provide the proofs for all our theoretical results, including: proof of Theorem <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 4.1. ‣ 4 Theoretical analysis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.1</span></a> in Appendix <a href="#A1.SS3" title="A.3 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.3</span></a>; proof of Theorem <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem3" title="Theorem 4.3. ‣ 4 Theoretical analysis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.3</span></a> in Appendix <a href="#A1.SS4" title="A.4 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.4</span></a>; proof of Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem2" title="Lemma A.2. ‣ A.2 Useful Lemmas ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a> in Appendix <a href="#A1.SS5" title="A.5 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.5</span></a>; proof of Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem3" title="Lemma A.3. ‣ A.2 Useful Lemmas ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.3</span></a> in Appendix <a href="#A1.SS6" title="A.6 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.6</span></a>. In Appendix <a href="#A2" title="Appendix B Experimental details" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B</span></a>, we provide additional information about our experiments, including: sufficient details about experimental settings in Appendix <a href="#A2.SS1" title="B.1 Experimental settings ‣ Appendix B Experimental details" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.1</span></a>; demo code in Appendix <a href="#A2.SS2" title="B.2 Demo notebook code for Algorithm ‣ Appendix B Experimental details" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.2</span></a>; additional results in Appendix <a href="#A2.SS3" title="B.3 Additional results ‣ Appendix B Experimental details" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.3</span></a> with performance across different shift intensities, types of environment shift, and further ablation studies for comparison with model-based RL. Finally, the source code to reproduce our results is available in the zipped file of this supplementary material.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Proofs</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we first formally introduce notations that will be used intensively in our proofs in Appendix <a href="#A1.SS1" title="A.1 Notations ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.1</span></a>, and then summarize our useful lemmas to support our proofs in Appendix <a href="#A1.SS2" title="A.2 Useful Lemmas ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Notations</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Notation in the finite-horizon episodic MDP</span>. Let <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{I}[A]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝕀</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{I}[A]</annotation></semantics></math> as the indicator function for event <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})</annotation></semantics></math> as the actual state-action pair observed and chosen at step <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math> of episode <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q_{h}^{k},V_{h}^{k},N_{h}^{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q_{h}^{k},V_{h}^{k},N_{h}^{k}</annotation></semantics></math> as the <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q_{h},V_{h},N_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q_{h},V_{h},N_{h}</annotation></semantics></math> functions at the beginning of episode <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>, respectively. Using this notation and let <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=N_{h}^{k}(s,a)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=N_{h}^{k}(s,a)</annotation></semantics></math> and suppose <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(s,a)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(s,a)</annotation></semantics></math> was previously taken at step <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math> of episodes <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k_{1},\cdots,k_{t}&lt;k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k_{1},\cdots,k_{t}&lt;k</annotation></semantics></math>, the update equation at episode <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> in Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ 3 Shift-Aware Density Q-Learning UCB" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> can be rewritten as follows, for every <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h\in[H]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h\in[H]</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A1.EGx15" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E13"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E13.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle Q_{h}^{k}(s,a)=\alpha_{t}^{0}H+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[r_{h}(s,a)+V_{h+1}^{k_{i}}(s_{h+1}^{k_{i}})+b_{i}\right]," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle Q_{h}^{k}(s,a)=\alpha_{t}^{0}H+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[r_{h}(s,a)+V_{h+1}^{k_{i}}(s_{h+1}^{k_{i}})+b_{i}\right],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(13)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E14"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle V_{h}^{k}(s)\leftarrow\min\{H,\max_{a^{\prime}\in\mathcal{A}}Q_{h}^{k}(s,a^{\prime})\},\forall s\in\mathcal{S}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle V_{h}^{k}(s)\leftarrow\min\{H,\max_{a^{\prime}\in\mathcal{A}}Q_{h}^{k}(s,a^{\prime})\},\forall s\in\mathcal{S}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(14)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Let <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m15" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\left[\mathbb{P}_{h}V_{h+1}\right](s,a):=\mathbb{E}_{s^{\prime}\sim\mathbb{P}_{h}(\cdot|s,a)}V_{h+1}(s^{\prime})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>:=</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>∼</mo><mi>ℙ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left[\mathbb{P}_{h}V_{h+1}\right](s,a):=\mathbb{E}_{s^{\prime}\sim\mathbb{P}_{h}(\cdot|s,a)}V_{h+1}(s^{\prime})</annotation></semantics></math> and its empirical counterpart of episode <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> as <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left[\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}V_{h+1}\right](s,a):=V_{h+1}(s_{h+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>:=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left[\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}V_{h+1}\right](s,a):=V_{h+1}(s_{h+1})</annotation></semantics></math>, which is defined only for <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(s,a)=(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(s,a)=(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Notation in the infinite-horizon discounted MDP</span>. Let <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>Q</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q^{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{Q}^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{Q}^{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>V</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V^{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{V}^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{V}^{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>N</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N^{t}</annotation></semantics></math> are the value of <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{Q}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{Q}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>V</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{V}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{V}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> right before the <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>-th step, respectively. Let <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau(s,a,i)=\max\{t:N^{t}(s,a)=i-1\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>N</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau(s,a,i)=\max\{t:N^{t}(s,a)=i-1\}</annotation></semantics></math> be the step <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> at which <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(s^{t},a^{t})=(s,a)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(s^{t},a^{t})=(s,a)</annotation></semantics></math> for the <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>-th time. From the update rule in the Algorithm <a href="#alg2" title="Algorithm 2 ‣ 3 Shift-Aware Density Q-Learning UCB" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>, we have</p>
<table id="A1.EGx16" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E15"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E15.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hat{Q}^{t}(s,a)=\alpha_{t}^{0}\frac{1}{1-\gamma}+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[r(s,a)+\gamma\hat{V}_{t+i}(s_{t_{i}+1})+b_{t}\right]," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hat{Q}^{t}(s,a)=\alpha_{t}^{0}\frac{1}{1-\gamma}+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[r(s,a)+\gamma\hat{V}_{t+i}(s_{t_{i}+1})+b_{t}\right],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(15)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E16"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle Q^{t}(s,a)=\min\{\hat{Q}^{t}(s,a),Q^{t}(s,a)\},\quad\hat{V}^{t}(s)\leftarrow\max_{a^{\prime}\in\mathcal{A}}\hat{Q}^{t}(s,a^{\prime}),\forall s\in\mathcal{S}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle Q^{t}(s,a)=\min\{\hat{Q}^{t}(s,a),Q^{t}(s,a)\},\quad\hat{V}^{t}(s)\leftarrow\max_{a^{\prime}\in\mathcal{A}}\hat{Q}^{t}(s,a^{\prime}),\forall s\in\mathcal{S}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(16)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Useful Lemmas</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Our proofs in this section are based on the following provable lemmas:</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma A.1</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(Learning rate properties <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">Jin et al., 2018</a>; <a href="#bib.bib33" title="" class="ltx_ref">Wang et al., 2020</a>)</cite>).
For the learning rate <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{t}=\frac{H+1}{H+t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{t}=\frac{H+1}{H+t}</annotation></semantics></math>, let <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{t}^{0}=\prod_{j=1}^{t}(1-\alpha_{j})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∏</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{t}^{0}=\prod_{j=1}^{t}(1-\alpha_{j})</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{t}^{i}=\alpha_{i}\prod_{j=i+1}^{t}(1-\alpha_{j})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∏</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{t}^{i}=\alpha_{i}\prod_{j=i+1}^{t}(1-\alpha_{j})</annotation></semantics></math>, then we have <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}=1</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{t}^{0}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{t}^{0}=0</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\geq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}=0</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{t}^{0}=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{t}^{0}=1</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=0</annotation></semantics></math>. And, the following properties hold for <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{t}^{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{t}^{i}</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></p>
<ol id="A1.I1" class="ltx_enumerate ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(a)</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{1}{\sqrt{t}}\leq\sum_{i=1}^{t}\frac{\alpha_{t}^{i}}{\sqrt{i}}\leq\frac{2}{\sqrt{t}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>t</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo rspace="0.111em">≤</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mfrac><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><msqrt><mi>i</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>t</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{1}{\sqrt{t}}\leq\sum_{i=1}^{t}\frac{\alpha_{t}^{i}}{\sqrt{i}}\leq\frac{2}{\sqrt{t}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> for every </span><math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\geq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(b)</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\max_{i\in[t]}\alpha_{t}^{i}\leq\frac{2H}{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\max_{i\in[t]}\alpha_{t}^{i}\leq\frac{2H}{t}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> and </span><math id="A1.I1.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{i=1}^{t}(\alpha_{t}^{i})^{2}\leq\frac{2H}{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></msubsup><msup><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{i=1}^{t}(\alpha_{t}^{i})^{2}\leq\frac{2H}{t}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> for every </span><math id="A1.I1.i2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\geq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(c)</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{t=i}^{\infty}\alpha_{t}^{i}=1+\frac{1}{H}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>H</mi></mfrac></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{t=i}^{\infty}\alpha_{t}^{i}=1+\frac{1}{H}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> for every </span><math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\geq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(d)</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sqrt{\frac{\iota(t)}{t}}\leq\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\sqrt{\frac{\iota(i)}{i}}\leq 2\sqrt{\frac{\iota(t)}{t}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>ι</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo rspace="0.111em">≤</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>ι</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>ι</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sqrt{\frac{\iota(t)}{t}}\leq\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\sqrt{\frac{\iota(i)}{i}}\leq 2\sqrt{\frac{\iota(t)}{t}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">, where </span><math id="A1.I1.i4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\iota(t)=\ln(c(t+1)(t+2))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>ι</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\iota(t)=\ln(c(t+1)(t+2))</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">, for every </span><math id="A1.I1.i4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\geq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">, </span><math id="A1.I1.i4.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c\geq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span></p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem2" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma A.2</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(Bound on <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q^{k}_{h}-Q^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q^{k}_{h}-Q^{*}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q^{k}_{h}-\bar{Q}^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q^{k}_{h}-\bar{Q}^{*}</annotation></semantics></math>). There exists an absolute constant <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> s.t., for any <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p\in(0,1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p\in(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math>, letting <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b_{t}=\frac{c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}\sqrt{H^{3}\iota/t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b_{t}=\frac{c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}\sqrt{H^{3}\iota/t}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=N_{h}(s,a)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=N_{h}(s,a)</annotation></semantics></math>, we have <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{t}=2\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}b_{i}\leq 4\frac{c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}\sqrt{H^{3}\iota/t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{t}=2\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}b_{i}\leq 4\frac{c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}\sqrt{H^{3}\iota/t}</annotation></semantics></math> and, for simultaneously <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\forall(s,a,h,k)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}\times[H]\times[K]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>∀</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>H</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\forall(s,a,h,k)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}\times[H]\times[K]</annotation></semantics></math>, with probability at least <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\delta</annotation></semantics></math>, it holds that</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx17" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex8"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle 0\leq(Q_{h}^{k}-Q_{h}^{*})(s,a)\leq\alpha_{t}^{0}H+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left(V_{h+1}^{k_{i}}-V_{h+1}^{*}\right)(s_{h+1}^{k_{i}})+\beta_{t}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle 0\leq(Q_{h}^{k}-Q_{h}^{*})(s,a)\leq\alpha_{t}^{0}H+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left(V_{h+1}^{k_{i}}-V_{h+1}^{*}\right)(s_{h+1}^{k_{i}})+\beta_{t},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">and</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx18" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex9"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle 0\leq(Q_{h}^{k}-\bar{Q}_{h}^{*})(s,a)\leq\alpha_{t}^{0}H+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left(V_{h+1}^{k_{i}}-\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*}\right)(s_{h+1}^{k_{i}})+\beta_{t}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle 0\leq(Q_{h}^{k}-\bar{Q}_{h}^{*})(s,a)\leq\alpha_{t}^{0}H+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left(V_{h+1}^{k_{i}}-\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*}\right)(s_{h+1}^{k_{i}})+\beta_{t}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">The proof is in Appendix <a href="#A1.SS5" title="A.5 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.5</span></a>.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem3" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma A.3</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(Bound on <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q^{t}-Q^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q^{t}-Q^{*}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q^{t}-\bar{Q}^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q^{t}-\bar{Q}^{*}</annotation></semantics></math>). There exists an absolute constant <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{2}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{2}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> s.t., for any <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p\in(0,1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p\in(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math>, letting <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=N_{p}(s,a)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=N_{p}(s,a)</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{i}=\tau(s,a,i)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{i}=\tau(s,a,i)</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b_{t}=\frac{c_{2}}{(1-\gamma)p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)}\sqrt{H\iota(t)/t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b_{t}=\frac{c_{2}}{(1-\gamma)p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)}\sqrt{H\iota(t)/t}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{t}\leq\frac{c_{3}}{(1-\gamma)p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)}\sqrt{H\iota(t)/t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{t}\leq\frac{c_{3}}{(1-\gamma)p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)}\sqrt{H\iota(t)/t}</annotation></semantics></math> and, for simultaneously <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\forall(s,a,t)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}\times[T]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>∀</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\forall(s,a,t)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}\times[T]</annotation></semantics></math>, with probability at least <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\delta</annotation></semantics></math>, it holds that</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx19" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex10"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle 0\leq(\hat{Q}^{t}-Q^{*})(s,a)\leq(Q^{t}-Q^{*})(s,a)\leq\frac{\alpha_{t}^{0}}{1-\gamma}+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\gamma\alpha_{t}^{i}\left(\hat{V}_{t_{i}}-V^{*}\right)(s_{t_{i}+1})+\beta_{t}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>V</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle 0\leq(\hat{Q}^{t}-Q^{*})(s,a)\leq(Q^{t}-Q^{*})(s,a)\leq\frac{\alpha_{t}^{0}}{1-\gamma}+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\gamma\alpha_{t}^{i}\left(\hat{V}_{t_{i}}-V^{*}\right)(s_{t_{i}+1})+\beta_{t},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">and</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx20" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex11"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle 0\leq(\hat{Q}^{t}-\bar{Q}^{*})(s,a)\leq(Q^{t}-\bar{Q}^{*})(s,a)\leq\frac{\alpha_{t}^{0}}{1-\gamma}+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\gamma\alpha_{t}^{i}\left(\hat{V}_{t_{i}}-\bar{V}^{*}\right)(s_{t_{i}+1})+\beta_{t}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle 0\leq(\hat{Q}^{t}-\bar{Q}^{*})(s,a)\leq(Q^{t}-\bar{Q}^{*})(s,a)\leq\frac{\alpha_{t}^{0}}{1-\gamma}+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\gamma\alpha_{t}^{i}\left(\hat{V}_{t_{i}}-\bar{V}^{*}\right)(s_{t_{i}+1})+\beta_{t}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">The proof is in Appendix <a href="#A1.SS6" title="A.6 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.6</span></a>.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Proof of Theorem <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 4.1. ‣ 4 Theoretical analysis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.1</span></a></h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text">Recall by our notation in Appendix <a href="#A1.SS1" title="A.1 Notations ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.1</span></a>, <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\left[\mathbb{P}_{h}V_{h+1}\right](s,a)=\mathbb{E}_{s^{\prime}\sim\mathbb{P}_{h}(\cdot|s,a)}V_{h+1}(s^{\prime})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>∼</mo><mi>ℙ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left[\mathbb{P}_{h}V_{h+1}\right](s,a)=\mathbb{E}_{s^{\prime}\sim\mathbb{P}_{h}(\cdot|s,a)}V_{h+1}(s^{\prime})</annotation></semantics></math> and its empirical counterpart of episode <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> is <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left[\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}V_{h+1}\right](s,a)=V_{h+1}(s_{h+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left[\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}V_{h+1}\right](s,a)=V_{h+1}(s_{h+1})</annotation></semantics></math>. By Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem2" title="Lemma A.2. ‣ A.2 Useful Lemmas ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a>, with probability at least <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\delta</annotation></semantics></math>, we have <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q_{h}^{k}\geq Q_{h}^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>≥</mo><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q_{h}^{k}\geq Q_{h}^{*}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q_{h}^{k}\geq\bar{Q}_{h}^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>≥</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q_{h}^{k}\geq\bar{Q}_{h}^{*}</annotation></semantics></math>, i.e., <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V_{h}^{k}\geq V_{h}^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>≥</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V_{h}^{k}\geq V_{h}^{*}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V_{h}^{k}\geq\bar{V}_{h}^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>≥</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V_{h}^{k}\geq\bar{V}_{h}^{*}</annotation></semantics></math>, thus</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx21" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E17"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\text{Regret}(K)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Regret</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\text{Regret}(K)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E17.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}(V_{1}^{*}-V_{1}^{\pi_{k}})(s_{1}^{k})+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}(\bar{V}_{1}^{*}-\bar{V}_{1}^{\pi_{k}})(s_{1}^{k})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>1</mn><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}(V_{1}^{*}-V_{1}^{\pi_{k}})(s_{1}^{k})+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}(\bar{V}_{1}^{*}-\bar{V}_{1}^{\pi_{k}})(s_{1}^{k})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(17)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E18"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}(V_{1}^{k}-V_{1}^{\pi_{k}})(s_{1}^{k})+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}(V_{1}^{k}-\bar{V}_{1}^{\pi_{k}})(s_{1}^{k})." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}(V_{1}^{k}-V_{1}^{\pi_{k}})(s_{1}^{k})+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}(V_{1}^{k}-\bar{V}_{1}^{\pi_{k}})(s_{1}^{k}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(18)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text">For any fixed <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(k,h)\in\{1,\cdots,\bar{K}\}\times[H]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(k,h)\in\{1,\cdots,\bar{K}\}\times[H]</annotation></semantics></math>, let <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{h}^{k}:=\left(V_{h}^{k}-V_{h}^{\pi_{k}}\right)(s_{1}^{k})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{h}^{k}:=\left(V_{h}^{k}-V_{h}^{\pi_{k}}\right)(s_{1}^{k})</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\phi_{h}^{k}:=\left(V_{h}^{k}-V_{h}^{*}\right)(s_{h}^{k})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\phi_{h}^{k}:=\left(V_{h}^{k}-V_{h}^{*}\right)(s_{h}^{k})</annotation></semantics></math>, then we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx22" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E19"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\delta_{h}^{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\delta_{h}^{k}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E19.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left(V_{h}^{k}-V_{h}^{\pi_{k}}\right)(s_{1}^{k})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left(V_{h}^{k}-V_{h}^{\pi_{k}}\right)(s_{1}^{k})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(19)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E20"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\left(Q_{h}^{k}-Q_{h}^{\pi_{k}}\right)(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})\left(\text{by }V_{h}^{k}(s_{h}^{k})\leq\max_{a^{\prime}\in\mathcal{A}}Q_{h}^{k}(s_{h}^{k},a^{\prime})=Q_{h}^{k}(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext>by </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\left(Q_{h}^{k}-Q_{h}^{\pi_{k}}\right)(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})\left(\text{by }V_{h}^{k}(s_{h}^{k})\leq\max_{a^{\prime}\in\mathcal{A}}Q_{h}^{k}(s_{h}^{k},a^{\prime})=Q_{h}^{k}(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(20)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E21"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left(Q_{h}^{k}-Q_{h}^{*}\right)(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})+\left(Q_{h}^{*}-Q_{h}^{\pi_{k}}\right)(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left(Q_{h}^{k}-Q_{h}^{*}\right)(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})+\left(Q_{h}^{*}-Q_{h}^{\pi_{k}}\right)(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(21)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E22"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\alpha_{t}^{0}H+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\phi_{h+1}^{k_{i}}+\beta_{t}+\left[\mathbb{P}_{h}\left(V_{h+1}^{*}-V_{h+1}^{\pi_{k}}\right)\right](s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})\left(\text{by Lemma~\ref{lemma:boundQ}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mtext>by Lemma </mtext><mtext><a href="#A1.Thmtheorem2" title="Lemma A.2. ‣ A.2 Useful Lemmas ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a></mtext></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\alpha_{t}^{0}H+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\phi_{h+1}^{k_{i}}+\beta_{t}+\left[\mathbb{P}_{h}\left(V_{h+1}^{*}-V_{h+1}^{\pi_{k}}\right)\right](s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})\left(\text{by Lemma~\ref{lemma:boundQ}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(22)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E23"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\alpha_{t}^{0}H+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\phi_{h+1}^{k_{i}}+\beta_{t}-\phi_{h+1}^{k}+\delta_{h+1}^{k}+\xi_{h+1}^{k}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>ξ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\alpha_{t}^{0}H+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\phi_{h+1}^{k_{i}}+\beta_{t}-\phi_{h+1}^{k}+\delta_{h+1}^{k}+\xi_{h+1}^{k},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(23)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text">where <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{t}=2\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}b_{i}\leq 4\frac{c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}\sqrt{H^{3}\iota/t}\leq 4\left(\frac{c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}+c\epsilon\right)\sqrt{H^{3}\iota/t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{t}=2\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}b_{i}\leq 4\frac{c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}\sqrt{H^{3}\iota/t}\leq 4\left(\frac{c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}+c\epsilon\right)\sqrt{H^{3}\iota/t}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=N_{h}(s,a)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=N_{h}(s,a)</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\xi_{h+1}^{k}:=\left[(\mathbb{P}_{h}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k})(V_{h+1}^{*}-V_{h+1}^{k})\right](s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>ξ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\xi_{h+1}^{k}:=\left[(\mathbb{P}_{h}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k})(V_{h+1}^{*}-V_{h+1}^{k})\right](s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})</annotation></semantics></math> is a martingale difference sequence.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">Similarly, by Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem2" title="Lemma A.2. ‣ A.2 Useful Lemmas ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a>, for any fixed <math id="A1.SS3.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(k,h)\in\{\bar{K}+1,\cdots,K\}\times[H]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(k,h)\in\{\bar{K}+1,\cdots,K\}\times[H]</annotation></semantics></math>, let <math id="A1.SS3.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\delta}_{h}^{k}:=\left(V_{h}^{k}-\bar{V}_{h}^{\pi_{k}}\right)(s_{1}^{k})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\delta}_{h}^{k}:=\left(V_{h}^{k}-\bar{V}_{h}^{\pi_{k}}\right)(s_{1}^{k})</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS3.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\phi}_{h}^{k}:=\left(V_{h}^{k}-\bar{V}_{h}^{*}\right)(s_{h}^{k})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\phi}_{h}^{k}:=\left(V_{h}^{k}-\bar{V}_{h}^{*}\right)(s_{h}^{k})</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx23" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E24"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\bar{\delta}_{h}^{k}=\alpha_{t}^{0}H+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k_{i}}+\beta_{t}-\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k}+\bar{\delta}_{h+1}^{k}+\bar{\xi}_{h+1}^{k}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ξ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\bar{\delta}_{h}^{k}=\alpha_{t}^{0}H+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k_{i}}+\beta_{t}-\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k}+\bar{\delta}_{h+1}^{k}+\bar{\xi}_{h+1}^{k},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(24)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text">where <math id="A1.SS3.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\xi}_{h+1}^{k}:=\left[(\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k})(\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*}-V_{h+1}^{k})\right](s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ξ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\xi}_{h+1}^{k}:=\left[(\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k})(\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*}-V_{h+1}^{k})\right](s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">Hence, from Equation <a href="#A1.E17" title="Equation 17 ‣ Proof. ‣ A.3 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">17</span></a>, the regret bound becomes</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx24" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E25"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E25.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\text{Regret}(K)\leq\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\delta_{h}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\delta}_{h}^{k}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Regret</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\text{Regret}(K)\leq\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\delta_{h}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\delta}_{h}^{k}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(25)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p3.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p3.2.1" class="ltx_text">Denoting by <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{h}^{k}=N_{h}^{k}(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{h}^{k}=N_{h}^{k}(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})</annotation></semantics></math>, then we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx25" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E26"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E26.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\alpha_{n_{h}^{k}}^{0}H+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\alpha_{n_{h}^{k}}^{0}H=\sum_{k=1}^{K}\alpha_{n_{h}^{k}}^{0}H=\sum_{k=1}^{K}H\cdot\mathbb{I}[n_{h}^{k}=0]\leq|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|H." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>α</mi><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>α</mi><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>α</mi><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝕀</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0em">≤</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\alpha_{n_{h}^{k}}^{0}H+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\alpha_{n_{h}^{k}}^{0}H=\sum_{k=1}^{K}\alpha_{n_{h}^{k}}^{0}H=\sum_{k=1}^{K}H\cdot\mathbb{I}[n_{h}^{k}=0]\leq|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|H.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(26)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p3.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p3.3.1" class="ltx_text">Let <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k_{i}(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k_{i}(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})</annotation></semantics></math> is the episode of which <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})</annotation></semantics></math> was taken at step <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math> for the <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i-th" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i-th</annotation></semantics></math> time. For every <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k^{\prime}\in\{1,\cdots,\bar{K}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k^{\prime}\in\{1,\cdots,\bar{K}\}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k^{\prime}\in\{\bar{K}+1,\cdots,K\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k^{\prime}\in\{\bar{K}+1,\cdots,K\}</annotation></semantics></math>, the corresponding term <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\phi_{h+1}^{k^{\prime}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\phi_{h+1}^{k^{\prime}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k^{\prime}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k^{\prime}}</annotation></semantics></math> appears in the summand with <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k&gt;k^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k&gt;k^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> iff <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})=(s_{h}^{k^{\prime}},a_{h}^{k^{\prime}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><msup><mi>k</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi><msup><mi>k</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})=(s_{h}^{k^{\prime}},a_{h}^{k^{\prime}})</annotation></semantics></math>. The first time it appears we have <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{h}^{k}=n_{h}^{k^{\prime}}+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><msup><mi>k</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{h}^{k}=n_{h}^{k^{\prime}}+1</annotation></semantics></math>, the second time we have <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{h}^{k}=n_{h}^{k^{\prime}}+2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><msup><mi>k</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{h}^{k}=n_{h}^{k^{\prime}}+2</annotation></semantics></math>, etc. Hence, we obtain the following bound</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx26" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E27"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\sum_{i=1}^{n_{h}^{k}}\alpha_{n_{h}^{k}}^{i}\phi_{h+1}^{k_{i}(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\sum_{i=1}^{n_{h}^{k}}\alpha_{n_{h}^{k}}^{i}\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k_{i}(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})}\leq\sum_{k^{\prime}=1}^{\bar{K}}\phi_{h+1}^{k^{\prime}}\sum_{t=n_{h}^{k^{\prime}}+1}^{\infty}\alpha_{t}^{n_{h}^{k^{\prime}}}+\sum_{k^{\prime}=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k^{\prime}}\sum_{t=n_{h}^{k^{\prime}}+1}^{\infty}\alpha_{t}^{n_{h}^{k^{\prime}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><msup><mi>k</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><msup><mi>k</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msubsup></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><msup><mi>k</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><msup><mi>k</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msubsup></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\sum_{i=1}^{n_{h}^{k}}\alpha_{n_{h}^{k}}^{i}\phi_{h+1}^{k_{i}(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\sum_{i=1}^{n_{h}^{k}}\alpha_{n_{h}^{k}}^{i}\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k_{i}(s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})}\leq\sum_{k^{\prime}=1}^{\bar{K}}\phi_{h+1}^{k^{\prime}}\sum_{t=n_{h}^{k^{\prime}}+1}^{\infty}\alpha_{t}^{n_{h}^{k^{\prime}}}+\sum_{k^{\prime}=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k^{\prime}}\sum_{t=n_{h}^{k^{\prime}}+1}^{\infty}\alpha_{t}^{n_{h}^{k^{\prime}}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(27)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E28"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E28.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\left(1+\frac{1}{H}\right)\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\phi_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k}\right)\left(\text{by $\sum_{t=i}^{\infty}\alpha_{t}^{i}=1+\frac{1}{H}$ from Lemma~\ref{lemma:learningrate}}\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>H</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mtext>by </mtext><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>H</mi></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mtext> from Lemma </mtext><mtext><a href="#A1.Thmtheorem1" title="Lemma A.1. ‣ A.2 Useful Lemmas ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.1</span></a></mtext></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\left(1+\frac{1}{H}\right)\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\phi_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k}\right)\left(\text{by $\sum_{t=i}^{\infty}\alpha_{t}^{i}=1+\frac{1}{H}$ from Lemma~\ref{lemma:learningrate}}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(28)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p3.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p3.4.1" class="ltx_text">Therefore, the regret bound becomes</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx27" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E29"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E29.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\text{Regret}(K)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Regret</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\text{Regret}(K)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E29.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\delta_{h}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\delta}_{h}^{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\delta_{h}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\delta}_{h}^{k}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(29)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex12"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\alpha_{t}^{0}H+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\phi_{h+1}^{k_{i}}+\beta_{t}-\phi_{h+1}^{k}+\delta_{h+1}^{k}+\xi_{h+1}^{k}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>ξ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\alpha_{t}^{0}H+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\phi_{h+1}^{k_{i}}+\beta_{t}-\phi_{h+1}^{k}+\delta_{h+1}^{k}+\xi_{h+1}^{k}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E30"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E30.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\left(\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\alpha_{t}^{0}H+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k_{i}}+\beta_{t}-\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k}+\bar{\delta}_{h+1}^{k}+\bar{\xi}_{h+1}^{k}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ξ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\left(\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\alpha_{t}^{0}H+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k_{i}}+\beta_{t}-\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k}+\bar{\delta}_{h+1}^{k}+\bar{\xi}_{h+1}^{k}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(30)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex13"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|H+\left(1+\frac{1}{H}\right)\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\phi_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k}\right)-\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\phi_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>H</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|H+\left(1+\frac{1}{H}\right)\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\phi_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k}\right)-\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\phi_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E31"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E31.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\delta_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\delta}_{h+1}^{k}\right)+\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\beta_{n_{h}^{k}}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\beta_{n_{h}^{k}}\right)+\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\xi_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\xi}_{h+1}^{k}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>β</mi><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>β</mi><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>ξ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ξ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\delta_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\delta}_{h+1}^{k}\right)+\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\beta_{n_{h}^{k}}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\beta_{n_{h}^{k}}\right)+\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\xi_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\xi}_{h+1}^{k}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(31)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex14"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|H+\left(1+\frac{1}{H}\right)\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\phi_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k}\right)+\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\delta_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\delta}_{h+1}^{k}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>H</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|H+\left(1+\frac{1}{H}\right)\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\phi_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k}\right)+\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\delta_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\delta}_{h+1}^{k}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E32"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E32.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{k=1}^{K}\beta_{n_{h}^{k}}+\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\xi_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\xi}_{h+1}^{k}\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>β</mi><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>ξ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ξ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{k=1}^{K}\beta_{n_{h}^{k}}+\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\xi_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\xi}_{h+1}^{k}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(32)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p3.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p3.5.1" class="ltx_text">Combining with the fact that <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V^{*}\geq V^{\pi_{k}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>≥</mo><msup><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V^{*}\geq V^{\pi_{k}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{V}^{*}\geq\bar{V}^{\pi_{k}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>≥</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{V}^{*}\geq\bar{V}^{\pi_{k}}</annotation></semantics></math>, yielding <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\phi_{h+1}^{k}\leq\delta_{h+1}^{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\phi_{h+1}^{k}\leq\delta_{h+1}^{k}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k}\leq\bar{\delta}_{h+1}^{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\phi}_{h+1}^{k}\leq\bar{\delta}_{h+1}^{k}</annotation></semantics></math>, thus we get</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx28" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E33"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E33.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\text{Regret}(K)\leq|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|H+\left(1+\frac{1}{H}\right)\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\delta_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\delta}_{h+1}^{k}\right)+\sum_{k=1}^{K}\beta_{n_{h}^{k}}+\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\xi_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\xi}_{h+1}^{k}\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Regret</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>H</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>β</mi><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>ξ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ξ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\text{Regret}(K)\leq|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|H+\left(1+\frac{1}{H}\right)\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\delta_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\delta}_{h+1}^{k}\right)+\sum_{k=1}^{K}\beta_{n_{h}^{k}}+\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\xi_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\xi}_{h+1}^{k}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(33)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p3.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p3.6.1" class="ltx_text">Recursing the result for <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h=1,2,\cdots,H" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h=1,2,\cdots,H</annotation></semantics></math>, and using the fact that <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{H+1}^{K}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{H+1}^{K}=0</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx29" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E34"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E34.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\text{Regret}(K)\leq\mathcal{O}\left(H^{2}|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|+\sum_{h=1}^{H}\sum_{k=1}^{K}\beta_{n_{h}^{k}}+\sum_{h=1}^{H}\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\xi_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\xi}_{h+1}^{k}\right)\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Regret</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>H</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>β</mi><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>H</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>ξ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ξ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\text{Regret}(K)\leq\mathcal{O}\left(H^{2}|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|+\sum_{h=1}^{H}\sum_{k=1}^{K}\beta_{n_{h}^{k}}+\sum_{h=1}^{H}\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\xi_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\xi}_{h+1}^{k}\right)\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(34)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p3.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p3.7.1" class="ltx_text">On the one hand, the r.v. <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\xi_{h+1}^{k}:=\left[(\mathbb{P}_{h}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k})(V_{h+1}^{*}-V_{h+1}^{k})\right](s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>ξ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\xi_{h+1}^{k}:=\left[(\mathbb{P}_{h}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k})(V_{h+1}^{*}-V_{h+1}^{k})\right](s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})</annotation></semantics></math> is a martingale difference sequence because if we define <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{F}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{F}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> be the <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma-" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma-</annotation></semantics></math>field generated by all the r.v. until episode <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>, step <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math>, then, <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\xi_{h+1}^{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>ξ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\xi_{h+1}^{k}</annotation></semantics></math> is a martingale difference sequence w.r.t the filtration <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\mathcal{F}_{i}\}_{i\geq 0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\mathcal{F}_{i}\}_{i\geq 0}</annotation></semantics></math>. Hence, by the Azuma-Hoeffding inequality, with probability <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\delta</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx30" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex15"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left|\sum_{h=1}^{H}\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\xi_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\xi}_{h+1}^{k}\right)\right|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>H</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>ξ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ξ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left|\sum_{h=1}^{H}\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\xi_{h+1}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\xi}_{h+1}^{k}\right)\right|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex15.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\left|\sum_{h=1}^{H}\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\left[(\mathbb{P}_{h}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k})(V_{h+1}^{*}-V_{h+1}^{k})\right](s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})\right.\right." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em">|</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>H</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left|\sum_{h=1}^{H}\left(\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\left[(\mathbb{P}_{h}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k})(V_{h+1}^{*}-V_{h+1}^{k})\right](s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})\right.\right.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E35"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E35.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\left.\left.\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\left[(\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k})(\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*}-V_{h+1}^{k})\right](s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})\right)\right|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo><mo fence="false">|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\left.\left.\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\left[(\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k})(\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*}-V_{h+1}^{k})\right](s_{h}^{k},a_{h}^{k})\right)\right|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(35)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E36"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E36.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{c}{\min_{h\in[H]}p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}H\sqrt{KH\iota}\leq\left(\frac{c}{\min_{h\in[H]}p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}+c\epsilon\right)H\sqrt{KH\iota}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>min</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>min</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{c}{\min_{h\in[H]}p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}H\sqrt{KH\iota}\leq\left(\frac{c}{\min_{h\in[H]}p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}+c\epsilon\right)H\sqrt{KH\iota}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(36)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p3.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p3.8.1" class="ltx_text">On the other hand, by the pigeonhole principle,</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx31" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E37"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E37.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{h=1}^{H}\sum_{k=1}^{K}\beta_{n_{h}^{k}}\leq\sum_{h=1}^{H}\mathcal{O}(1+\epsilon)\sum_{k=1}^{K}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{n_{h}^{k}}}=\sum_{h=1}^{H}\mathcal{O}(1+\epsilon)\sum_{s,a}\sum_{n=1}^{N_{h}^{K}(s,a)}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{n}}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>H</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>β</mi><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>H</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>H</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>K</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></munderover></mstyle><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{h=1}^{H}\sum_{k=1}^{K}\beta_{n_{h}^{k}}\leq\sum_{h=1}^{H}\mathcal{O}(1+\epsilon)\sum_{k=1}^{K}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{n_{h}^{k}}}=\sum_{h=1}^{H}\mathcal{O}(1+\epsilon)\sum_{s,a}\sum_{n=1}^{N_{h}^{K}(s,a)}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{n}},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(37)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p3.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p3.9.1" class="ltx_text">combining with the fact that <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{s,a}N_{h}^{K}(s,a)=K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msubsup><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>K</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{s,a}N_{h}^{K}(s,a)=K</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{s,a}\sum_{n=1}^{N_{h}^{K}(s,a)}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{n}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msubsup><mo lspace="0.167em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>K</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msubsup><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{s,a}\sum_{n=1}^{N_{h}^{K}(s,a)}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{n}}</annotation></semantics></math> is maximized when <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m30" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N_{h}^{K}(s,a)=K/|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>K</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>/</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N_{h}^{K}(s,a)=K/|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m31" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s,a" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s,a</annotation></semantics></math>, we get</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx32" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E38"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E38.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{h=1}^{H}\sum_{k=1}^{K}\beta_{n_{h}^{k}}\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\sqrt{H^{5}(1+\epsilon)^{2}|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|K\iota}\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>H</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>β</mi><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>K</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{h=1}^{H}\sum_{k=1}^{K}\beta_{n_{h}^{k}}\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\sqrt{H^{5}(1+\epsilon)^{2}|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|K\iota}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(38)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p3.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p3.10.1" class="ltx_text">Note that when <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m32" class="ltx_Math" alttext="KH\geq\sqrt{H^{5}(1+\epsilon)^{2}|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|T\iota}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo>≥</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">KH\geq\sqrt{H^{5}(1+\epsilon)^{2}|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|T\iota}</annotation></semantics></math>, by infinitely nested radical, we have <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m33" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sqrt{H^{5}(1+\epsilon)^{2}\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|K\iota}\geq H^{2}|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi></mrow><mo fence="false">|</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>K</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sqrt{H^{5}(1+\epsilon)^{2}\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|K\iota}\geq H^{2}|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|</annotation></semantics></math>. And, when <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m34" class="ltx_Math" alttext="KH\leq\sqrt{H^{5}(1+\epsilon)^{2}|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|K\iota}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>K</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">KH\leq\sqrt{H^{5}(1+\epsilon)^{2}|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|K\iota}</annotation></semantics></math>, by the worst case of regret is <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m35" class="ltx_Math" alttext="KH" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">KH</annotation></semantics></math>, we have <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m36" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\delta_{h}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\delta}_{h}^{k}\leq KH\leq\sqrt{H^{5}(1+\epsilon)^{2}|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|K\iota}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></msubsup><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>K</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\delta_{h}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\delta}_{h}^{k}\leq KH\leq\sqrt{H^{5}(1+\epsilon)^{2}|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|K\iota}</annotation></semantics></math>. Therefore, by <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m37" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\iota=\log(|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|KH/\delta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ι</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>K</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\iota=\log(|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|KH/\delta)</annotation></semantics></math>, with probability at least <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m38" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\delta</annotation></semantics></math>, we obtain</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx33" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E39"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E39.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\text{Regret}(K)\leq\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\delta_{h}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\delta}_{h}^{k}\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\sqrt{H^{5}(1+\epsilon)^{2}|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|K\log(|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|KH/\delta)}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext>Regret</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>K</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>K</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\text{Regret}(K)\leq\sum_{k=1}^{\bar{K}}\delta_{h}^{k}+\sum_{k=\bar{K}+1}^{K}\bar{\delta}_{h}^{k}\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\sqrt{H^{5}(1+\epsilon)^{2}|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|K\log(|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|KH/\delta)}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(39)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p3.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p3.11.1" class="ltx_text">of Theorem <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 4.1. ‣ 4 Theoretical analysis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.1</span></a>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.4 </span>Proof of Theorem <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem3" title="Theorem 4.3. ‣ 4 Theoretical analysis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.3</span></a></h3>

<div id="A1.SS4.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text">Similar to the proof in Theorem <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 4.1. ‣ 4 Theoretical analysis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.1</span></a>, this proof is based on the bound on learning error of <math id="A1.SS4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math>-function in the infinite-horizon discounted MDP setting. Firstly, from Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem3" title="Lemma A.3. ‣ A.2 Useful Lemmas ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.3</span></a>, we can see that the different between the bound of <math id="A1.SS4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\hat{Q}^{t}-Q^{*})(s,a)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\hat{Q}^{t}-Q^{*})(s,a)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\hat{Q}^{t}-\bar{Q}^{*})(s,a)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\hat{Q}^{t}-\bar{Q}^{*})(s,a)</annotation></semantics></math> is only in <math id="A1.SS4.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>V</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V^{*}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS4.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{V}^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{V}^{*}</annotation></semantics></math>. Therefore, we can borrow Theorem 7.3 of <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib36" title="" class="ltx_ref">Yang et al. (2021)</a></cite>, i.e., with probability at least <math id="A1.SS4.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\delta</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="A1.SS4.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta=1/T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta=1/T</annotation></semantics></math>, for every <math id="A1.SS4.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n\in[\lceil\log_{2}(1/\Delta_{\min}(1-\gamma))\rceil]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌈</mo><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>min</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌉</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n\in[\lceil\log_{2}(1/\Delta_{\min}(1-\gamma))\rceil]</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx34" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E40"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E40.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle C^{(n)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle C^{(n)}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E40.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle:=\left|\left\{t\in\mathbb{N}_{+}:\left(\hat{Q}^{t}-Q^{*}\right)(s_{t},a_{t})\in\left[2^{n-1}\Delta_{\min},2^{n}\Delta_{\min}\right]\right\}\right|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>ℕ</mi><mo>+</mo></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>min</mi></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>min</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle:=\left|\left\{t\in\mathbb{N}_{+}:\left(\hat{Q}^{t}-Q^{*}\right)(s_{t},a_{t})\in\left[2^{n-1}\Delta_{\min},2^{n}\Delta_{\min}\right]\right\}\right|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(40)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E41"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E41.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|(1+\epsilon)}{4^{n}(1-\gamma)^{5}\Delta_{\min}^{2}}\ln\left(\frac{|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|T}{(1-\gamma)\Delta_{\min}}\right)\right)," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>5</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>min</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>min</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|(1+\epsilon)}{4^{n}(1-\gamma)^{5}\Delta_{\min}^{2}}\ln\left(\frac{|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|T}{(1-\gamma)\Delta_{\min}}\right)\right),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(41)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS4.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS4.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text">and for every <math id="A1.SS4.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n\in[\lceil\log_{2}(1/\bar{\Delta}_{\min}(1-\gamma))\rceil]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌈</mo><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>min</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌉</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n\in[\lceil\log_{2}(1/\bar{\Delta}_{\min}(1-\gamma))\rceil]</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx35" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E42"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E42.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\bar{C}^{(n)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\bar{C}^{(n)}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E42.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle:=\left|\left\{t\in\mathbb{N}_{+}:\left(\hat{Q}^{t}-\bar{Q}^{*}\right)(s_{t},a_{t})\in\left[2^{n-1}\bar{\Delta}_{\min},2^{n}\bar{\Delta}_{\min}\right]\right\}\right|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>ℕ</mi><mo>+</mo></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>min</mi></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>min</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle:=\left|\left\{t\in\mathbb{N}_{+}:\left(\hat{Q}^{t}-\bar{Q}^{*}\right)(s_{t},a_{t})\in\left[2^{n-1}\bar{\Delta}_{\min},2^{n}\bar{\Delta}_{\min}\right]\right\}\right|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(42)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E43"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E43.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|(1+\epsilon)}{4^{n}(1-\gamma)^{5}\bar{\Delta}_{\min}^{2}}\ln\left(\frac{|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|T}{(1-\gamma)\bar{\Delta}_{\min}}\right)\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>5</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>min</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>min</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|(1+\epsilon)}{4^{n}(1-\gamma)^{5}\bar{\Delta}_{\min}^{2}}\ln\left(\frac{|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|T}{(1-\gamma)\bar{\Delta}_{\min}}\right)\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(43)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS4.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS4.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS4.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">By the definition of the sub-optimality gap, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx36" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E44"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E44.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\text{Regret}(T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Regret</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\text{Regret}(T)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E44.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{t=1}^{\bar{T}}\left(V^{*}-V^{\pi_{t}}\right)(s_{t})+\sum_{t=\bar{T}+1}^{T}\left(\bar{V}^{*}-\bar{V}^{\pi_{t}}\right)(s_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{t=1}^{\bar{T}}\left(V^{*}-V^{\pi_{t}}\right)(s_{t})+\sum_{t=\bar{T}+1}^{T}\left(\bar{V}^{*}-\bar{V}^{\pi_{t}}\right)(s_{t})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(44)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex16"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{t=1}^{\bar{T}}\mathbb{E}\left[\sum_{h=0}^{\infty}\gamma^{h}\Delta(s_{t+h},a_{t+h})\Big|a_{t+h}=\pi_{t+h}(s_{t+h})\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>γ</mi><mi>h</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo fence="false" maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="true">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{t=1}^{\bar{T}}\mathbb{E}\left[\sum_{h=0}^{\infty}\gamma^{h}\Delta(s_{t+h},a_{t+h})\Big|a_{t+h}=\pi_{t+h}(s_{t+h})\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E45"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E45.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{t=\bar{T}+1}^{T}\mathbb{E}\left[\sum_{h=0}^{\infty}\gamma^{h}\bar{\Delta}(s_{t+h},a_{t+h})\Big|a_{t+h}=\pi_{t+h}(s_{t+h})\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mo>[</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><msup><mi>γ</mi><mi>h</mi></msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo fence="false" maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="true">|</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{t=\bar{T}+1}^{T}\mathbb{E}\left[\sum_{h=0}^{\infty}\gamma^{h}\bar{\Delta}(s_{t+h},a_{t+h})\Big|a_{t+h}=\pi_{t+h}(s_{t+h})\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(45)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E46"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E46.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{t=1}^{\bar{T}}\mathbb{E}\left[\sum_{h=0}^{\infty}\gamma^{h}\Delta(s_{t+h},a_{t+h})\right]+\sum_{t=\bar{T}+1}^{T}\mathbb{E}\left[\sum_{h=0}^{\infty}\gamma^{h}\bar{\Delta(}s_{t+h},a_{t+h})\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mo>[</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><msup><mi>γ</mi><mi>h</mi></msup><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mo>[</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><msup><mi>γ</mi><mi>h</mi></msup><mover accent="true"><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">CLOSE</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>¯</mo></mover><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{t=1}^{\bar{T}}\mathbb{E}\left[\sum_{h=0}^{\infty}\gamma^{h}\Delta(s_{t+h},a_{t+h})\right]+\sum_{t=\bar{T}+1}^{T}\mathbb{E}\left[\sum_{h=0}^{\infty}\gamma^{h}\bar{\Delta(}s_{t+h},a_{t+h})\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(46)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E47"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E47.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{t=1}^{\bar{T}}\sum_{h^{\prime}=t}^{\infty}\gamma^{h^{\prime}-t}\Delta(s_{h^{\prime}},a_{h^{\prime}})+\sum_{t=\bar{T}+1}^{T}\sum_{h^{\prime}=t}^{\infty}\gamma^{h^{\prime}-t}\bar{\Delta}(s_{h^{\prime}},a_{h^{\prime}})." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{t=1}^{\bar{T}}\sum_{h^{\prime}=t}^{\infty}\gamma^{h^{\prime}-t}\Delta(s_{h^{\prime}},a_{h^{\prime}})+\sum_{t=\bar{T}+1}^{T}\sum_{h^{\prime}=t}^{\infty}\gamma^{h^{\prime}-t}\bar{\Delta}(s_{h^{\prime}},a_{h^{\prime}}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(47)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS4.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS4.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS4.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">For a fixed <math id="A1.SS4.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, for every infinite-length trajectory <math id="A1.SS4.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="traj" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">traj</annotation></semantics></math>, the trajectories inside the event in which all the learning errors of the value function is both bounded below (by zero) and bounded above, we can apply the concentration bound with Azuma–Hoeffding to the sub-optimality gap <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib36" title="" class="ltx_ref">Yang et al., 2021</a>)</cite>, whereas for trajectories outside of this event, the sub-optimality gaps never exceed the time horizon. Hence, by the Azuma–Hoeffding inequality, with probability at least <math id="A1.SS4.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\delta</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx37" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E48"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E48.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\text{Regret}(T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Regret</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\text{Regret}(T)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E48.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\sum_{t=1}^{\bar{T}}\sum_{traj}p(traj)\left[\sum_{h^{\prime}=t}^{\infty}\gamma^{h^{\prime}-t}\Delta(s_{h^{\prime}},a_{h^{\prime}})\right]+\sum_{t=\bar{T}+1}^{T}\sum_{traj}p(traj)\left[\sum_{h^{\prime}=t}^{\infty}\gamma^{h^{\prime}-t}\bar{\Delta}(s_{h^{\prime}},a_{h^{\prime}})\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\sum_{t=1}^{\bar{T}}\sum_{traj}p(traj)\left[\sum_{h^{\prime}=t}^{\infty}\gamma^{h^{\prime}-t}\Delta(s_{h^{\prime}},a_{h^{\prime}})\right]+\sum_{t=\bar{T}+1}^{T}\sum_{traj}p(traj)\left[\sum_{h^{\prime}=t}^{\infty}\gamma^{h^{\prime}-t}\bar{\Delta}(s_{h^{\prime}},a_{h^{\prime}})\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(48)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E49"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E49.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{t=1}^{\bar{T}}\sum_{h^{\prime}=t}^{\infty}\gamma^{h^{\prime}-t}\Delta(s_{h^{\prime}},a_{h^{\prime}}|traj)+\sum_{t=\bar{T}+1}^{T}\sum_{h^{\prime}=t}^{\infty}\gamma^{h^{\prime}-t}\bar{\Delta}(s_{h^{\prime}},a_{h^{\prime}}|traj)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{t=1}^{\bar{T}}\sum_{h^{\prime}=t}^{\infty}\gamma^{h^{\prime}-t}\Delta(s_{h^{\prime}},a_{h^{\prime}}|traj)+\sum_{t=\bar{T}+1}^{T}\sum_{h^{\prime}=t}^{\infty}\gamma^{h^{\prime}-t}\bar{\Delta}(s_{h^{\prime}},a_{h^{\prime}}|traj)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(49)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E50"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E50.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{h=1}^{\infty}\Delta(s_{h},a_{h})\sum_{t=1}^{\min\{\bar{T},h\}}\gamma^{t}+\sum_{h=1}^{\infty}\bar{\Delta}(s_{h},a_{h})\sum_{t=\bar{T}+1}^{\min\{T,h\}}\gamma^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></munderover></mstyle><msup><mi>γ</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></munderover></mstyle><msup><mi>γ</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{h=1}^{\infty}\Delta(s_{h},a_{h})\sum_{t=1}^{\min\{\bar{T},h\}}\gamma^{t}+\sum_{h=1}^{\infty}\bar{\Delta}(s_{h},a_{h})\sum_{t=\bar{T}+1}^{\min\{T,h\}}\gamma^{t}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(50)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E51"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E51.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq 2\max\left\{\frac{1}{1-\gamma}\sum_{h=1}^{\infty}\Delta(s_{h},a_{h}|traj),\frac{1}{1-\gamma}\sum_{h=1}^{\infty}\bar{\Delta}(s_{h},a_{h}|traj)\right\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq 2\max\left\{\frac{1}{1-\gamma}\sum_{h=1}^{\infty}\Delta(s_{h},a_{h}|traj),\frac{1}{1-\gamma}\sum_{h=1}^{\infty}\bar{\Delta}(s_{h},a_{h}|traj)\right\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(51)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex17"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad\left(\text{By the optimism of estimated $Q$-values}\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mtext>By the optimism of estimated </mtext><mi>Q</mi><mtext>-values</mtext></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad\left(\text{By the optimism of estimated $Q$-values}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS4.p3.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS4.p3.2.1" class="ltx_text">Since we can add an outer summation over sub-intervals <math id="A1.SS4.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n\in[N]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n\in[N]</annotation></semantics></math> and bound each of them by their maximum value times the number of steps inside, we get</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx38" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E52"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E52.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\text{Regret}(T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Regret</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\text{Regret}(T)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E52.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq 2\max\left\{\frac{1}{1-\gamma}\sum_{n=1}^{N}2^{n}\Delta_{\min}C^{(n)},\frac{1}{1-\gamma}\sum_{n=1}^{N}2^{n}\bar{\Delta}_{\min}\bar{C}^{(n)}\right\}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>min</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>min</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq 2\max\left\{\frac{1}{1-\gamma}\sum_{n=1}^{N}2^{n}\Delta_{\min}C^{(n)},\frac{1}{1-\gamma}\sum_{n=1}^{N}2^{n}\bar{\Delta}_{\min}\bar{C}^{(n)}\right\}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(52)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS4.p3.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS4.p3.3.1" class="ltx_text">Using results in Equation <a href="#A1.E40" title="Equation 40 ‣ Proof. ‣ A.4 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">40</span></a> and Equation <a href="#A1.E42" title="Equation 42 ‣ Proof. ‣ A.4 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">42</span></a>, we obtain</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx39" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E53"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E53.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\text{Regret}(T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Regret</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\text{Regret}(T)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E53.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\max\left\{\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|(1+\epsilon)}{(1-\gamma)^{6}\Delta_{\min}}\log\left(\frac{|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|T}{(1-\gamma)\Delta_{\min}}\right)\right),\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|(1+\epsilon)}{(1-\gamma)^{6}\bar{\Delta}_{\min}}\log\left(\frac{|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|T}{(1-\gamma)\bar{\Delta}_{\min}}\right)\right)\right\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>6</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>min</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>min</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>6</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>min</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>min</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\max\left\{\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|(1+\epsilon)}{(1-\gamma)^{6}\Delta_{\min}}\log\left(\frac{|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|T}{(1-\gamma)\Delta_{\min}}\right)\right),\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|(1+\epsilon)}{(1-\gamma)^{6}\bar{\Delta}_{\min}}\log\left(\frac{|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|T}{(1-\gamma)\bar{\Delta}_{\min}}\right)\right)\right\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(53)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E54"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E54.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|(1+\epsilon)}{(1-\gamma)^{6}\min\{\Delta_{\min},\bar{\Delta}_{\min}\}}\log\left(\frac{|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|T}{(1-\gamma)\min\{\Delta_{\min},\bar{\Delta}_{\min}\}}\right)\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>6</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>min</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>min</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>min</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>min</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|(1+\epsilon)}{(1-\gamma)^{6}\min\{\Delta_{\min},\bar{\Delta}_{\min}\}}\log\left(\frac{|\mathcal{S}||\mathcal{A}|T}{(1-\gamma)\min\{\Delta_{\min},\bar{\Delta}_{\min}\}}\right)\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(54)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS4.p3.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS4.p3.4.1" class="ltx_text">of Theorem <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem3" title="Theorem 4.3. ‣ 4 Theoretical analysis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.3</span></a>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.5 </span>Proof of Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem2" title="Lemma A.2. ‣ A.2 Useful Lemmas ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a></h3>

<div id="A1.SS5.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text">For any <math id="A1.SS5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(s,a,h)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}\times[H]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(s,a,h)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}\times[H]</annotation></semantics></math> and episode <math id="A1.SS5.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k\in[K]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k\in[K]</annotation></semantics></math>, from the Bellman optimality equation, <math id="A1.SS5.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q_{h}^{*}(s,a)=(r_{h}+\mathbb{P}_{h}V_{h+1}^{*})(s,a)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q_{h}^{*}(s,a)=(r_{h}+\mathbb{P}_{h}V_{h+1}^{*})(s,a)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS5.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{Q}_{h}^{*}(s,a)=(r_{h}+\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*})(s,a)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{Q}_{h}^{*}(s,a)=(r_{h}+\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*})(s,a)</annotation></semantics></math>, since <math id="A1.SS5.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left[\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}}V_{h+1}\right](s,a)=V_{h+1}(s_{h+1}^{k_{i}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left[\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}}V_{h+1}\right](s,a)=V_{h+1}(s_{h+1}^{k_{i}})</annotation></semantics></math>, we have <math id="A1.SS5.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left[\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}}\bar{V}_{h+1}\right](s,a)=\bar{V}_{h+1}(s_{h+1}^{k_{i}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left[\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}}\bar{V}_{h+1}\right](s,a)=\bar{V}_{h+1}(s_{h+1}^{k_{i}})</annotation></semantics></math>, thus</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx40" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E55"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E55.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle Q_{h}^{*}(s,a)=\alpha_{t}^{0}Q_{h}^{*}(s,a)+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[r_{h}(s,a)+(\mathbb{P}_{h}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}})V_{h+1}^{*}(s,a)+V_{h+1}^{*}(s_{h+1}^{k_{i}})\right]," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle Q_{h}^{*}(s,a)=\alpha_{t}^{0}Q_{h}^{*}(s,a)+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[r_{h}(s,a)+(\mathbb{P}_{h}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}})V_{h+1}^{*}(s,a)+V_{h+1}^{*}(s_{h+1}^{k_{i}})\right],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(55)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E56"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E56.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\bar{Q}_{h}^{*}(s,a)=\alpha_{t}^{0}\bar{Q}_{h}^{*}(s,a)+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[r_{h}(s,a)+(\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}})\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*}(s,a)+\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*}(s_{h+1}^{k_{i}})\right]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\bar{Q}_{h}^{*}(s,a)=\alpha_{t}^{0}\bar{Q}_{h}^{*}(s,a)+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[r_{h}(s,a)+(\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}})\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*}(s,a)+\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*}(s_{h+1}^{k_{i}})\right].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(56)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text">Subtracting to <math id="A1.SS5.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q_{h}^{k}(s,a)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q_{h}^{k}(s,a)</annotation></semantics></math> in Equation <a href="#A1.E13" title="Equation 13 ‣ A.1 Notations ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>, we obtain</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx41" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E57"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E57.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(Q_{h}^{k}-Q_{h}^{*})(s,a)=\alpha_{t}^{0}(H-Q_{h}^{*}(s,a))+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[(V_{h+1}^{k_{i}}-V_{h+1}^{*})(s_{h+1}^{k_{i}})+\left[(\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}}-\mathbb{P}_{h})V_{h+1}^{*}\right](s,a)+b_{i}\right]," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(Q_{h}^{k}-Q_{h}^{*})(s,a)=\alpha_{t}^{0}(H-Q_{h}^{*}(s,a))+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[(V_{h+1}^{k_{i}}-V_{h+1}^{*})(s_{h+1}^{k_{i}})+\left[(\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}}-\mathbb{P}_{h})V_{h+1}^{*}\right](s,a)+b_{i}\right],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(57)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E58"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E58.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(Q_{h}^{k}-\bar{Q}_{h}^{*})(s,a)=\alpha_{t}^{0}(H-\bar{Q}_{h}^{*}(s,a))+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[(V_{h+1}^{k_{i}}-\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*})(s_{h+1}^{k_{i}})+\left[(\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}}-\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h})\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*}\right](s,a)+b_{i}\right]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(Q_{h}^{k}-\bar{Q}_{h}^{*})(s,a)=\alpha_{t}^{0}(H-\bar{Q}_{h}^{*}(s,a))+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[(V_{h+1}^{k_{i}}-\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*})(s_{h+1}^{k_{i}})+\left[(\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}}-\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h})\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*}\right](s,a)+b_{i}\right].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(58)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text">If <math id="A1.SS5.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=N_{h}^{k}(s,a)\in\{1,\cdots,\bar{K}-1\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=N_{h}^{k}(s,a)\in\{1,\cdots,\bar{K}-1\}</annotation></semantics></math>, the transition operator at step <math id="A1.SS5.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math> is <math id="A1.SS5.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{P}_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{P}_{h}</annotation></semantics></math>, then <math id="A1.SS5.p1.m11" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})=\mathbb{P}_{h}/\mathbb{P}_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})=\mathbb{P}_{h}/\mathbb{P}_{h}</annotation></semantics></math>, and for all <math id="A1.SS5.p1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(s,a,h,k)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}\times[H]\times\{1,\cdots,\bar{K}-1\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>H</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(s,a,h,k)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}\times[H]\times\{1,\cdots,\bar{K}-1\}</annotation></semantics></math>, from Lemma 4.3 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">Jin et al., 2018</a>)</cite>, with probability at least <math id="A1.SS5.p1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\delta</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx42" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E59"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E59.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[(\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}}-\mathbb{P}_{h})V_{h+1}^{*}\right](s,a)\right|\leq c\frac{\mathbb{P}_{h}}{\mathbb{P}_{h}}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{t}}=\frac{c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{t}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[(\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}}-\mathbb{P}_{h})V_{h+1}^{*}\right](s,a)\right|\leq c\frac{\mathbb{P}_{h}}{\mathbb{P}_{h}}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{t}}=\frac{c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{t}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(59)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS5.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS5.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">Consider the transition operator at step <math id="A1.SS5.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math> change from <math id="A1.SS5.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{P}_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{P}_{h}</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A1.SS5.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}</annotation></semantics></math> at episode <math id="A1.SS5.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{K}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{K}</annotation></semantics></math>, then <math id="A1.SS5.p2.m5" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})=\mathbb{P}_{h}/\mathbb{P}_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})=\mathbb{P}_{h}/\mathbb{P}_{h}</annotation></semantics></math> before <math id="A1.SS5.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{K}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{K}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS5.p2.m7" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})=\mathbb{P}_{h}/\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>/</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})=\mathbb{P}_{h}/\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}</annotation></semantics></math> at <math id="A1.SS5.p2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{K}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{K}</annotation></semantics></math>, and for <math id="A1.SS5.p2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=\bar{K}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=\bar{K}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS5.p2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\forall(s,a,h,k)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}\times[H]\times\{\bar{K}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>∀</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>H</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\forall(s,a,h,k)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}\times[H]\times\{\bar{K}\}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx43" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E60"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E60.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[(\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}}-\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h})\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*}\right](s,a)\right|=\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[(\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}}-\mathbb{P}_{h})V_{h+1}^{*}\right](s,a)\right|\frac{\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}}{\mathbb{P}_{h}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msub><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[(\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}}-\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h})\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*}\right](s,a)\right|=\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[(\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}}-\mathbb{P}_{h})V_{h+1}^{*}\right](s,a)\right|\frac{\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}}{\mathbb{P}_{h}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(60)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text">Hence, using the result in Equation <a href="#A1.E59" title="Equation 59 ‣ Proof. ‣ A.5 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">59</span></a>, we get</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx44" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E61"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E61.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[(\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}}-\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h})\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*}\right](s,a)\right|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[(\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}}-\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h})\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*}\right](s,a)\right|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E61.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq c\frac{\mathbb{P}_{h}}{\mathbb{P}_{h}}\frac{\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}}{\mathbb{P}_{h}}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{t}}=c\frac{\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}}{\mathbb{P}_{h}}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{t}}=\frac{c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{t}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msub><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msub><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq c\frac{\mathbb{P}_{h}}{\mathbb{P}_{h}}\frac{\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}}{\mathbb{P}_{h}}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{t}}=c\frac{\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}}{\mathbb{P}_{h}}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{t}}=\frac{c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{t}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(61)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS5.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS5.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">And, when the transition operator at step <math id="A1.SS5.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math> is <math id="A1.SS5.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}</annotation></semantics></math> after <math id="A1.SS5.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{K}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{K}</annotation></semantics></math>, then <math id="A1.SS5.p3.m4" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})=\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}/\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>/</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})=\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}/\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}</annotation></semantics></math>, and for any <math id="A1.SS5.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in\{\bar{K}+1,\cdots,K\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in\{\bar{K}+1,\cdots,K\}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS5.p3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\forall(s,a,h,k)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}\times[H]\times\{\bar{K}+1,\cdots,K\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>∀</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>H</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\forall(s,a,h,k)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}\times[H]\times\{\bar{K}+1,\cdots,K\}</annotation></semantics></math>, with probability at least <math id="A1.SS5.p3.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\delta</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx45" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E62"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E62.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left|\sum_{i=\bar{K}+1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[(\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}}-\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h})\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*}\right](s,a)\right|\leq c\frac{\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}}{\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{t}}=\frac{c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{t}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>K</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msub><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left|\sum_{i=\bar{K}+1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[(\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}}-\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h})\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*}\right](s,a)\right|\leq c\frac{\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}}{\bar{\mathbb{P}}_{h}}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{t}}=\frac{c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{t}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(62)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS5.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS5.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text">Combining the result in Equation <a href="#A1.E59" title="Equation 59 ‣ Proof. ‣ A.5 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">59</span></a>, Equation <a href="#A1.E61" title="Equation 61 ‣ Proof. ‣ A.5 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">61</span></a>, and Equation <a href="#A1.E62" title="Equation 62 ‣ Proof. ‣ A.5 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">62</span></a>, we obtain for any <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[K]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[K]</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\forall(s,a,h,k)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}\times[H]\times[K]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>∀</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>H</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\forall(s,a,h,k)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}\times[H]\times[K]</annotation></semantics></math>, with probability at least <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\delta</annotation></semantics></math>, it holds that</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx46" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E63"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E63.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[(\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}}-\mathbb{P}_{h})V_{h+1}^{*}\right](s,a)\right|\leq\frac{c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{t}},\text{ where }t=N_{h}^{k}(s,a)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext> where </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[(\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{h}^{k_{i}}-\mathbb{P}_{h})V_{h+1}^{*}\right](s,a)\right|\leq\frac{c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{t}},\text{ where }t=N_{h}^{k}(s,a).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(63)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p4.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p4.2.1" class="ltx_text">Note that if we choose <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b_{t}=\frac{c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}\sqrt{H^{3}\iota/t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b_{t}=\frac{c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}\sqrt{H^{3}\iota/t}</annotation></semantics></math>, i.e., <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{t}=2\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}b_{i}\leq 4\frac{c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}\sqrt{H^{3}\iota/t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{t}=2\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}b_{i}\leq 4\frac{c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}\sqrt{H^{3}\iota/t}</annotation></semantics></math>, by Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem1" title="Lemma A.1. ‣ A.2 Useful Lemmas ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.1</span></a>, <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{t}/2=\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}b_{i}\in\left[\frac{c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{t}},\frac{2c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{t}}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{t}/2=\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}b_{i}\in\left[\frac{c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{t}},\frac{2c}{p(\cdot|s,a;\theta_{h})}\sqrt{\frac{H^{3}\iota}{t}}\right]</annotation></semantics></math>, combining with results in Equation <a href="#A1.E57" title="Equation 57 ‣ Proof. ‣ A.5 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">57</span></a> and Equation <a href="#A1.E63" title="Equation 63 ‣ Proof. ‣ A.5 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">63</span></a>, we obtain</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx47" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E64"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E64.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(Q_{h}^{k}-Q_{h}^{*})(s,a)\leq\alpha_{t}^{0}H+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left(V_{h+1}^{k_{i}}-V_{h+1}^{*}\right)(s_{h+1}^{k_{i}})+\beta_{t}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(Q_{h}^{k}-Q_{h}^{*})(s,a)\leq\alpha_{t}^{0}H+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left(V_{h+1}^{k_{i}}-V_{h+1}^{*}\right)(s_{h+1}^{k_{i}})+\beta_{t},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(64)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E65"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E65.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(Q_{h}^{k}-\bar{Q}_{h}^{*})(s,a)\leq\alpha_{t}^{0}H+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left(V_{h+1}^{k_{i}}-\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*}\right)(s_{h+1}^{k_{i}})+\beta_{t}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(Q_{h}^{k}-\bar{Q}_{h}^{*})(s,a)\leq\alpha_{t}^{0}H+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left(V_{h+1}^{k_{i}}-\bar{V}_{h+1}^{*}\right)(s_{h+1}^{k_{i}})+\beta_{t}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(65)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p4.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p4.3.1" class="ltx_text">On the other hand, applying induction on <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h=H,H-1,\cdots,1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h=H,H-1,\cdots,1</annotation></semantics></math> to results in Equation <a href="#A1.E57" title="Equation 57 ‣ Proof. ‣ A.5 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">57</span></a> and result in Equation <a href="#A1.E63" title="Equation 63 ‣ Proof. ‣ A.5 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">63</span></a>, we obtain</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx48" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E66"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E66.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle 0\leq(Q_{h}^{k}-Q_{h}^{*})(s,a),\quad 0\leq(Q_{h}^{k}-\bar{Q}_{h}^{*})(s,a)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle 0\leq(Q_{h}^{k}-Q_{h}^{*})(s,a),\quad 0\leq(Q_{h}^{k}-\bar{Q}_{h}^{*})(s,a).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(66)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p4.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p4.4.1" class="ltx_text">Combining results in Equation <a href="#A1.E64" title="Equation 64 ‣ Proof. ‣ A.5 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">64</span></a> and Equation <a href="#A1.E66" title="Equation 66 ‣ Proof. ‣ A.5 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">66</span></a>, we obtain the results of Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem2" title="Lemma A.2. ‣ A.2 Useful Lemmas ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS6" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.6 </span>Proof of Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem3" title="Lemma A.3. ‣ A.2 Useful Lemmas ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.3</span></a></h3>

<div id="A1.SS6.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text">For any <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(s,a)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(s,a)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}</annotation></semantics></math> and time step <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[T]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[T]</annotation></semantics></math>, from the Bellman optimality equation, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx49" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E67"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E67.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle Q^{*}(s,a)=r(s,a)+\gamma\mathbb{P}V^{*}(s,a)=\alpha_{t}^{0}Q^{*}(s,a)+\sum_{t=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[r(s,a)+\gamma\mathbb{P}V^{*}(s,a)\right]," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ℙ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>V</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ℙ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>V</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle Q^{*}(s,a)=r(s,a)+\gamma\mathbb{P}V^{*}(s,a)=\alpha_{t}^{0}Q^{*}(s,a)+\sum_{t=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[r(s,a)+\gamma\mathbb{P}V^{*}(s,a)\right],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(67)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E68"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E68.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\bar{Q}^{*}(s,a)=r(s,a)+\gamma\bar{\mathbb{P}}\bar{V}^{*}(s,a)=\alpha_{t}^{0}\bar{Q}^{*}(s,a)+\sum_{t=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[r(s,a)+\gamma\bar{\mathbb{P}}\bar{V}^{*}(s,a)\right]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\bar{Q}^{*}(s,a)=r(s,a)+\gamma\bar{\mathbb{P}}\bar{V}^{*}(s,a)=\alpha_{t}^{0}\bar{Q}^{*}(s,a)+\sum_{t=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[r(s,a)+\gamma\bar{\mathbb{P}}\bar{V}^{*}(s,a)\right].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(68)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS6.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text">Subtracting to <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{Q}^{t}(s,a)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{Q}^{t}(s,a)</annotation></semantics></math> in Equation <a href="#A1.E15" title="Equation 15 ‣ A.1 Notations ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a>, we obtain</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx50" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex18"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left(\hat{Q}^{t}-Q^{*}\right)(s,a)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left(\hat{Q}^{t}-Q^{*}\right)(s,a)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex18.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\alpha_{t}^{0}\left(\frac{1}{1-\gamma}-Q^{*}(s,a)\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\alpha_{t}^{0}\left(\frac{1}{1-\gamma}-Q^{*}(s,a)\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E69"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E69.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[\gamma(V_{t_{1}}-V^{*})(s_{t_{i}+1})+\gamma\left(V^{*}(s_{t_{i}+1})-\mathbb{P}V^{*}(s,a)\right)+b_{i}\right]," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>V</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>V</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>ℙ</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[\gamma(V_{t_{1}}-V^{*})(s_{t_{i}+1})+\gamma\left(V^{*}(s_{t_{i}+1})-\mathbb{P}V^{*}(s,a)\right)+b_{i}\right],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(69)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex19"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left(\hat{Q}^{t}-\bar{Q}^{*}\right)(s,a)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left(\hat{Q}^{t}-\bar{Q}^{*}\right)(s,a)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex19.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\alpha_{t}^{0}\left(\frac{1}{1-\gamma}-\bar{Q}^{*}(s,a)\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\alpha_{t}^{0}\left(\frac{1}{1-\gamma}-\bar{Q}^{*}(s,a)\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E70"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E70.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[\gamma(V_{t_{1}}-\bar{V}^{*})(s_{t_{i}+1})+\gamma\left(\bar{V}^{*}(s_{t_{i}+1})-\bar{\mathbb{P}}\bar{V}^{*}(s,a)\right)+b_{i}\right]," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[\gamma(V_{t_{1}}-\bar{V}^{*})(s_{t_{i}+1})+\gamma\left(\bar{V}^{*}(s_{t_{i}+1})-\bar{\mathbb{P}}\bar{V}^{*}(s,a)\right)+b_{i}\right],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(70)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS6.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text">If <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=N_{p}(s,a)\in\{1,\cdots,\bar{T}-1\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=N_{p}(s,a)\in\{1,\cdots,\bar{T}-1\}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{i}=\tau(s,a,i)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{i}=\tau(s,a,i)</annotation></semantics></math>, the transition operator at step <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> is <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{P}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ℙ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{P}</annotation></semantics></math>, then <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m8" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)=\mathbb{P}/\mathbb{P}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>ℙ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)=\mathbb{P}/\mathbb{P}</annotation></semantics></math>, and for all <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(s,a,t)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}\times\{1,\cdots,\bar{T}-1\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(s,a,t)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}\times\{1,\cdots,\bar{T}-1\}</annotation></semantics></math>, from Lemma 4 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib33" title="" class="ltx_ref">Wang et al., 2020</a>)</cite>, with probability at least <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\delta</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx51" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E71"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E71.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\gamma\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\left(\alpha_{k}^{i}\mathbb{I}[t_{i}&lt;\infty]\left(\mathbb{P}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{t_{i}}\right)V^{*}(s,a)\right)\right|\leq\frac{3c_{2}}{1-\gamma}\frac{\mathbb{P}}{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}}=\frac{3c_{2}}{(1-\gamma)p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em">|</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mi>𝕀</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo fence="false">|</mo><mo lspace="0.167em">≤</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></mfrac></mstyle><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\gamma\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\left(\alpha_{k}^{i}\mathbb{I}[t_{i}&lt;\infty]\left(\mathbb{P}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{t_{i}}\right)V^{*}(s,a)\right)\right|\leq\frac{3c_{2}}{1-\gamma}\frac{\mathbb{P}}{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}}=\frac{3c_{2}}{(1-\gamma)p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(71)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS6.p1.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p1.4.1" class="ltx_text">Consider the transition operator at step <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> change from <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{P}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ℙ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{P}</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\mathbb{P}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\mathbb{P}}</annotation></semantics></math> at time step <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{T}</annotation></semantics></math>, then <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m15" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)=\mathbb{P}/\mathbb{P}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>ℙ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)=\mathbb{P}/\mathbb{P}</annotation></semantics></math> before <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{T}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m17" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)=\mathbb{P}/\bar{\mathbb{P}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>/</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)=\mathbb{P}/\bar{\mathbb{P}}</annotation></semantics></math> at <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{T}</annotation></semantics></math>, and for any <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=\bar{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=\bar{T}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\forall(s,a,t)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}\times\{\bar{T}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>∀</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\forall(s,a,t)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}\times\{\bar{T}\}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx52" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E72"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E72.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\gamma\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\left(\alpha_{k}^{i}\mathbb{I}[t_{i}&lt;\infty]\left(\bar{\mathbb{P}}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{t_{i}}\right)\bar{V}^{*}(s,a)\right)\right|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em">|</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mi>𝕀</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo fence="false">|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\gamma\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\left(\alpha_{k}^{i}\mathbb{I}[t_{i}&lt;\infty]\left(\bar{\mathbb{P}}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{t_{i}}\right)\bar{V}^{*}(s,a)\right)\right|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E72.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\gamma\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\left(\alpha_{k}^{i}\mathbb{I}[t_{i}&lt;\infty]\left(\mathbb{P}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{t_{i}}\right)V^{*}(s,a)\right)\right|\frac{\bar{\mathbb{P}}}{\mathbb{P}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em">|</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mi>𝕀</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em">|</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>ℙ</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\gamma\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\left(\alpha_{k}^{i}\mathbb{I}[t_{i}&lt;\infty]\left(\mathbb{P}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{t_{i}}\right)V^{*}(s,a)\right)\right|\frac{\bar{\mathbb{P}}}{\mathbb{P}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(72)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS6.p1.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p1.5.1" class="ltx_text">Hence, using the result in Equation <a href="#A1.E71" title="Equation 71 ‣ Proof. ‣ A.6 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">71</span></a>, we get</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx53" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E73"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E73.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\gamma\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\left(\alpha_{k}^{i}\mathbb{I}[t_{i}&lt;\infty]\left(\bar{\mathbb{P}}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{t_{i}}\right)\bar{V}^{*}(s,a)\right)\right|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em">|</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mi>𝕀</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo fence="false">|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\gamma\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\left(\alpha_{k}^{i}\mathbb{I}[t_{i}&lt;\infty]\left(\bar{\mathbb{P}}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{t_{i}}\right)\bar{V}^{*}(s,a)\right)\right|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E73.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{3c_{2}}{(1-\gamma)}\frac{\mathbb{P}}{\mathbb{P}}\frac{\bar{\mathbb{P}}}{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}}=\frac{3c_{2}}{(1-\gamma)}\frac{\bar{\mathbb{P}}}{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>ℙ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>ℙ</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>ℙ</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{3c_{2}}{(1-\gamma)}\frac{\mathbb{P}}{\mathbb{P}}\frac{\bar{\mathbb{P}}}{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}}=\frac{3c_{2}}{(1-\gamma)}\frac{\bar{\mathbb{P}}}{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(73)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E74"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E74.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{3c_{2}}{(1-\gamma)p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{3c_{2}}{(1-\gamma)p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(74)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS6.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS6.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">And, when the transition operator at step <math id="A1.SS6.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> is <math id="A1.SS6.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\mathbb{P}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\mathbb{P}}</annotation></semantics></math> after <math id="A1.SS6.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{T}</annotation></semantics></math>, then <math id="A1.SS6.p2.m4" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)=\bar{\mathbb{P}}/\bar{\mathbb{P}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>/</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)=\bar{\mathbb{P}}/\bar{\mathbb{P}}</annotation></semantics></math>, and for any <math id="A1.SS6.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in\{\bar{T}+1,\cdots,T\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in\{\bar{T}+1,\cdots,T\}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS6.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\forall(s,a,t)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}\times\{\bar{T}+1,\cdots,T\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>∀</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\forall(s,a,t)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}\times\{\bar{T}+1,\cdots,T\}</annotation></semantics></math>, with probability at least <math id="A1.SS6.p2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\delta</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx54" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E75"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E75.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\gamma\left|\sum_{i=\bar{T}+1}^{t}\left(\alpha_{k}^{i}\mathbb{I}[t_{i}&lt;\infty]\left(\bar{\mathbb{P}}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{t_{i}}\right)\bar{V}^{*}(s,a)\right)\right|\leq\frac{3c_{2}}{1-\gamma}\frac{\bar{\mathbb{P}}}{\bar{\mathbb{P}}}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}}=\frac{3c_{2}}{(1-\gamma)p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em">|</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>T</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mi>𝕀</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo fence="false">|</mo><mo lspace="0.167em">≤</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mfrac></mstyle><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\gamma\left|\sum_{i=\bar{T}+1}^{t}\left(\alpha_{k}^{i}\mathbb{I}[t_{i}&lt;\infty]\left(\bar{\mathbb{P}}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{t_{i}}\right)\bar{V}^{*}(s,a)\right)\right|\leq\frac{3c_{2}}{1-\gamma}\frac{\bar{\mathbb{P}}}{\bar{\mathbb{P}}}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}}=\frac{3c_{2}}{(1-\gamma)p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(75)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS6.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS6.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">Combining the result in Equation <a href="#A1.E71" title="Equation 71 ‣ Proof. ‣ A.6 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">71</span></a>, Equation <a href="#A1.E73" title="Equation 73 ‣ Proof. ‣ A.6 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">73</span></a>, and Equation <a href="#A1.E75" title="Equation 75 ‣ Proof. ‣ A.6 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">75</span></a>, we obtain for any <math id="A1.SS6.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[K]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[K]</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS6.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\forall(s,a,t)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}\times[T]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>∀</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\forall(s,a,t)\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}\times[T]</annotation></semantics></math>, with probability at least <math id="A1.SS6.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\delta</annotation></semantics></math>, it holds that</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx55" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E76"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E76.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\gamma\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\left(\alpha_{k}^{i}\mathbb{I}[t_{i}&lt;\infty]\left(\mathbb{P}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{t_{i}}\right)V^{*}(s,a)\right)\right|\leq\frac{3c_{2}}{(1-\gamma)p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}},\text{ where }t=N_{p}(s,a)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em">|</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mi>𝕀</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo fence="false">|</mo><mo lspace="0.167em">≤</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mtext> where </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\gamma\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\left(\alpha_{k}^{i}\mathbb{I}[t_{i}&lt;\infty]\left(\mathbb{P}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{t_{i}}\right)V^{*}(s,a)\right)\right|\leq\frac{3c_{2}}{(1-\gamma)p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}},\text{ where }t=N_{p}(s,a).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(76)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS6.p3.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p3.2.1" class="ltx_text">Note that if we choose <math id="A1.SS6.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b_{t}=\frac{c_{2}}{(1-\gamma)p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b_{t}=\frac{c_{2}}{(1-\gamma)p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}}</annotation></semantics></math>, i.e., <math id="A1.SS6.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{t}=2\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}b_{i}\leq 4\frac{c_{2}}{(1-\gamma)p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{t}=2\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}b_{i}\leq 4\frac{c_{2}}{(1-\gamma)p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}}</annotation></semantics></math>, by Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem1" title="Lemma A.1. ‣ A.2 Useful Lemmas ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.1</span></a>, <math id="A1.SS6.p3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{t}/2=\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}b_{i}\in\left[\frac{c_{2}}{(1-\gamma)p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}},\frac{2c_{2}}{(1-\gamma)p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ι</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{t}/2=\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}b_{i}\in\left[\frac{c_{2}}{(1-\gamma)p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}},\frac{2c_{2}}{(1-\gamma)p(\cdot|s,a;\theta)}\sqrt{\frac{H\iota(t)}{t}}\right]</annotation></semantics></math>, combining with results in Equation <a href="#A1.Ex18" title="In Proof. ‣ A.6 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">69</span></a> and Equation <a href="#A1.E76" title="Equation 76 ‣ Proof. ‣ A.6 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">76</span></a>, we obtain</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx56" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex20"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(\hat{Q}^{t}-Q^{*})(s,a)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(\hat{Q}^{t}-Q^{*})(s,a)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex20.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{\alpha_{t}^{0}}{1-\gamma}+\gamma\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\left(\alpha_{k}^{i}\mathbb{I}[t_{i}&lt;\infty]\left(\mathbb{P}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{t_{i}}\right)V^{*}(s,a)\right)\right|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em">|</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mi>𝕀</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo fence="false">|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{\alpha_{t}^{0}}{1-\gamma}+\gamma\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\left(\alpha_{k}^{i}\mathbb{I}[t_{i}&lt;\infty]\left(\mathbb{P}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{t_{i}}\right)V^{*}(s,a)\right)\right|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E77"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E77.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[\gamma(\hat{V}_{t_{1}}-V^{*})(s_{t_{i}+1})+b_{i}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>V</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[\gamma(\hat{V}_{t_{1}}-V^{*})(s_{t_{i}+1})+b_{i}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(77)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E78"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E78.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{\alpha_{t}^{0}}{1-\gamma}+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\gamma\alpha_{t}^{i}\left(\hat{V}_{t_{i}}-V^{*}\right)(s_{t_{i}+1})+\beta_{t}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>V</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{\alpha_{t}^{0}}{1-\gamma}+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\gamma\alpha_{t}^{i}\left(\hat{V}_{t_{i}}-V^{*}\right)(s_{t_{i}+1})+\beta_{t},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(78)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS6.p3.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p3.3.1" class="ltx_text">and</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx57" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex21"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(\hat{Q}^{t}-\bar{Q}^{*})(s,a)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(\hat{Q}^{t}-\bar{Q}^{*})(s,a)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex21.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{\alpha_{t}^{0}}{1-\gamma}+\gamma\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\left(\alpha_{k}^{i}\mathbb{I}[t_{i}&lt;\infty]\left(\bar{\mathbb{P}}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{t_{i}}\right)\bar{V}^{*}(s,a)\right)\right|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em">|</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mi>𝕀</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo fence="false">|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{\alpha_{t}^{0}}{1-\gamma}+\gamma\left|\sum_{i=1}^{t}\left(\alpha_{k}^{i}\mathbb{I}[t_{i}&lt;\infty]\left(\bar{\mathbb{P}}-\hat{\mathbb{P}}_{t_{i}}\right)\bar{V}^{*}(s,a)\right)\right|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E79"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E79.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[\gamma(\hat{V}_{t_{1}}-\bar{V}^{*})(s_{t_{i}+1})+b_{i}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{t}^{i}\left[\gamma(\hat{V}_{t_{1}}-\bar{V}^{*})(s_{t_{i}+1})+b_{i}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(79)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E80"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E80.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{\alpha_{t}^{0}}{1-\gamma}+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\gamma\alpha_{t}^{i}\left(\hat{V}_{t_{i}}-\bar{V}^{*}\right)(s_{t_{i}+1})+\beta_{t}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{\alpha_{t}^{0}}{1-\gamma}+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\gamma\alpha_{t}^{i}\left(\hat{V}_{t_{i}}-\bar{V}^{*}\right)(s_{t_{i}+1})+\beta_{t}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(80)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS6.p3.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p3.4.1" class="ltx_text">On the other hand, applying induction on <math id="A1.SS6.p3.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=T,T-1,\cdots,1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=T,T-1,\cdots,1</annotation></semantics></math> to results in Equation <a href="#A1.Ex18" title="In Proof. ‣ A.6 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">69</span></a> and result in Equation <a href="#A1.E76" title="Equation 76 ‣ Proof. ‣ A.6 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">76</span></a>, we obtain</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx58" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E81"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E81.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle 0\leq(\hat{Q}^{t}-Q^{*})(s,a),\quad 0\leq(\hat{Q}^{t}-\bar{Q}^{*})(s,a)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle 0\leq(\hat{Q}^{t}-Q^{*})(s,a),\quad 0\leq(\hat{Q}^{t}-\bar{Q}^{*})(s,a).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(81)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS6.p3.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p3.5.1" class="ltx_text">Combining results in Equation <a href="#A1.Ex20" title="In Proof. ‣ A.6 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">77</span></a> and Equation <a href="#A1.E81" title="Equation 81 ‣ Proof. ‣ A.6 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">81</span></a>, we obtain the results of Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem3" title="Lemma A.3. ‣ A.2 Useful Lemmas ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.3</span></a>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Experimental details</h2>

<figure id="A2.F7" class="ltx_figure">
